的时候，改变两个铜片的正对面积从而改变其电容，当前收音机正在接收浙江经济广播电台（FM95）的节目，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/615afd4f301d8dda3ae9c110b869ed8d413eebf4bf8543f74db187eb3a5fc046.png","width":243,"height":218,"width_mm":28.524,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q07-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c613a7c3ab2b15967a8731f6cf005c29e93d2876f3570c6fe709c01bc31109c3.png","width":200,"height":371,"width_mm":23.371,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q07-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第7题图\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1e1aaa6495d2a8d17211f6597c3f06d69aecb23fe240869a9d86f691a027356c.png","width":397,"height":293,"width_mm":46.558,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q07-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 调节电容器会影响调谐电路中电流的周期"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 旋动调频旋钮，改变电容这一步属于电磁波发射与接收中的调制环节"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 不同电台发出的电磁波到达收音机处，会发生干涉，有些时候信号加强，有些时候信号减弱"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若要调台，改听浙江之声电台（FM88)，则需要将上右图中的动片逆时针旋转"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q08","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6fec1db6881231db795706da119bc5e7561d473e5f7aabbdcd35d6f5a0f441ec","body":[{"type":"text","value":"8. 如图，均匀介质中有且仅有一个点波源产生简谐横波在xy平面内传播，A(4,3)、B(4,0)在xy平面内。某时刻，A处质点位于波峰，B处质点位于波谷。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/edff4ea5d205de074f49e5b9e4d9cc98be25fe2fcf9e4bf40ad3bf379e6ec8e4.png","width":392,"height":322,"width_mm":46.006,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q08-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 8 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 若波源在(0,0)处，波长可能为1m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 若波源在(0,0)处，波长可能为2m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若波源在(0,3)处，波长可能为3m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若波源在(0,3)处，波长可能为4m"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q09","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"11695da458918a73dfb736c5bcdcfaa38ce171d0927cfbadb28f362af02b0b19","body":[{"type":"text","value":"9. “金星凌日”时，从地球上看，金星就像镶嵌在太阳表面的小黑点。在地球上间距为d的两点同时观测，测得金星在太阳表面的小黑点相距为L，如图所示。地球和金星绕太阳的运动均视为匀速圆周运动，太阳直径远小于金星的轨道半径，则地球和金星绕太阳运动的\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f1c9cc0d5dcdf50df955de63e564cea85d28877ac59bb5c24f66c5bf2952beb5.png","width":168,"height":406,"width_mm":19.69,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第9题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 轨道半径之比为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac { L } { d }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 周期之比为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt [ 3 ] { \\left( \\frac { L + d } { L } \\right) ^ { 2 } }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 线速度大小之比为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt { \\frac { L + d } { L } }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 向心加速度大小之比为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left( \\frac { L } { L + d } \\right) ^ { 2 }"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q10","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a181841fdfe0820fd21c280a4bc72a3352f70f0c18602dd8405f6d650fa1aed9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"10. 如图所示，足球队队员训练时在水平地面上踢出一个质量为m的足球。足球以初速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 、与水平地面成 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta _ { 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 角斜向上方飞出。足球在空中运动时受到空气阻力的作用，空气阻力大小满足"},{"type":"math","value":"f = k v"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其中k为常数，v为足球的瞬时速度大小，阻力的方向始终与速度方向相反。足球最终以速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 、与水平方向成 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 角斜向下击中球门上边框。已知球门上边框距地面的高度为h，地表重力加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":"。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0132c16b2b4343759329802a8438ef520940588564b6cb520bde6a673d8f9597.png","width":1300,"height":381,"width_mm":152.739,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 10 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 整个过程中球位移不可求"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 球在空中运动的时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{v_{1}\\sin\\theta_{1} + v_{2}\\sin\\theta_{2}}{g} - \\frac{kh}{mg}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 阻力做功的平均功率与足球质量m成正比"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 平均速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{m\\left(v_{1}\\cos\\theta_{1}-v_{2}\\cos\\theta_{2}\\right)}{k\\left(v_{1}\\sin\\theta_{1}+v_{2}\\sin\\theta_{2}\\right)}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q11","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"2199f7500be4177d781b4ef41ff3af3be392363f723250c5f40963b6bdba013c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11.水平地面上有一辆车，其车厢顶部用轻质绳悬挂了一小球。小球从A点静止释放，虚线为过A的等高线，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5fe95af0d0dacee14e4ecfb6f74b741dfc5e0340a560e69cf50f9fd19e698946.png","width":541,"height":251,"width_mm":63.488,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 11 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 由于小球机械能守恒，它一定能到虚线"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 如果车厢运动，小球运动过程中有可能高于虚线"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 如果车厢向左加速，小球一定能到虚线"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 如果车厢向右加速，小球一定能到虚线"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q12","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"63d9aaa7770fc61e022f765f0649efd0655334aaf5c488843a46f3ae41fbe0b6","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 1885年约翰巴耳末发现一个经验公式，可以用来计算氢原子发射谱线系列中某一个谱线系所有光谱线的波长，该谱线系称之为巴耳末系，其光谱线如图所示。巴耳末公式为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda=\\frac{1}{R_{\\infty}}\\cdot\\frac{4n^{2}}{n^{2}-4}(n=3,4,5,6)"},{"type":"text","value":"，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { \\infty }"},{"type":"text","value":" 为某一常量，n为正整数。巴耳末系的光谱线在可见光范围内包含4个波长的光谱线，根据波长由大到小分别称之为 "},{"type":"math","value":"H _ { \\alpha } ,\\; H _ { \\beta } ,\\; H _ { \\gamma }"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"H _ { \\delta }"},{"type":"text","value":" 。其中谱线 "},{"type":"math","value":"H _ { \\alpha }"},{"type":"text","value":" 的波长约为656nm，也是该谱线系中波长最长的谱线。用 "},{"type":"math","value":"H _ { \\gamma }"},{"type":"text","value":" 谱线所对应的光子照射金属钠，可以使得金属钠发生光电效应，并且测得光电子的最大初动能为0.58eV。若已知普朗克常数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 6.63 \\times 10^{-34} J \\cdot s"},{"type":"text","value":" ，光速 "},{"type":"math","value":"c = 3 \\times 10^{8} m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" ，元电荷量 "},{"type":"math","value":"e = 1.6 \\times 10^{-19} C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/40a98233c12c6a717a3c893ac912599375ef0de6f804c52e285cfa2a700ac1b9.png","width":853,"height":132,"width_mm":100.306,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q12-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3ed143794d70e6bb96177f3d5b725f43bae6881b052994fba50a2feb25b9635e.png","width":402,"height":399,"width_mm":47.272,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q12-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"H _ { \\alpha } ,\\; H _ { \\beta } ,\\; H _ { \\gamma } ,\\; H _ { \\delta }"},{"type":"text","value":" 谱线所对应的光子的能量逐渐减小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 巴耳末公式中的常数 "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { \\infty }"},{"type":"text","value":" 的值约为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 . 0 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ { 7 } m ^ { - 1 }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"H _ { \\gamma }"},{"type":"text","value":" 谱线所对应的波长约为410nm"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 用 "},{"type":"math","value":"H _ { \\delta }"},{"type":"text","value":" 谱线所对应的光子照射金属钠，也可以发生光电效应，光电子的最大初动能约为0.74eV"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q13","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7d9d722f44a713a5f1947a86d0e46acfcdbf21da8a4a49ed57214a8dde471876","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图，玻璃砖的横截面是半径为R的半圆，圆心为O点，直径与x轴重合。一束平行于x轴的黄光，从横截面上的P点由空气射入玻璃砖，从Q点射出。已知P点到x轴的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，P、Q间的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{3}R"},{"type":"text","value":" 。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0637baa14d0f8808f80744904885ca75f6ac9170a1d31c726fd9d56a1e64276b.png","width":473,"height":169,"width_mm":55.621,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 13 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 玻璃砖的折射率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt { 2 }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 在该横截面沿圆弧任意改变入射点的位置和入射方向，要使黄光能在圆心O点发生全反射，入射光线与x轴之间夹角的范围为 "},{"type":"math","value":"( 0 ^ { \\circ } , 6 0 ^ { \\circ } ]"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 入射点P不变，入射光从图中平行x轴方向逆时针转过 "},{"type":"math","value":"9 0 ^ { \\circ }"},{"type":"text","value":" 的过程中，x轴上玻璃砖直径处有光出射的长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"{ \\frac { \\sqrt { 6 } - { \\sqrt { 2 } } } { 2 } } R"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 其它条件不变，如果入射光换成紫光，则出射点移到Q点下方"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学","热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"08e4c44d949bb30d809794df5c6c6af7be414283f6058e632097cb7aefe455ee","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-I（4分）“探究小车速度随时间变化的规律”的实验装置如图甲所示。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b15646b01cd0caad60487b7d5c15bfa07a6ae3c216df1a3b42c275b958757eda.png","width":1286,"height":284,"width_mm":151.083,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14题图Ⅰ-甲\n（1）用图中计时器完成实验，应该选择接入的电源是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"（选填图乙的“A”“B”或“C”）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ef7af97242da2858a634e0ef320cef3c5208e0b37350c0114dadf19f5511a699.png","width":820,"height":363,"width_mm":96.244,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14题I-图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/50eafb41a10b83f1145690423b0dd284aa2382739179d994ba1e7acccf053c32.png","width":436,"height":350,"width_mm":56.274,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）用手拉着细线让小车做加速运动，从纸带上清晰的点开始，每隔0.1s依次剪断纸带，将相邻的短纸条下端对齐后并排粘贴，沿下边缘作出横坐标轴，沿第1段纸条左边缘建立纵坐标并标出数据。如图丙所示，可推测小车的加速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"。（选填“变大”、“变小”或“不变”）\n（3）用该实验装置做“研究加速度与力、质量的关系”实验①对该装置进行安装调试时，“补偿阻力”操作正确的是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"（多选）A. 将靠近滑轮一端垫高B. 将靠近打点计时器一端垫高C.“补偿阻力”时，需要给小车安装纸带D. 可目视观察小车的运动，来判断“补偿阻力”是否完成 ↑a\n②如图丁所示，在探究加速度a与F的关系时，保持小车的质量M不变，细线绕过滑轮挂上槽码，发现随着槽码质量增加a-F图线明显偏离直线的主要原因是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"A. 测量小车的加速度时，出现较大的误差B. 每次改变槽码质量时，没有重新进行“补偿阻力”\nC. 槽码质量变大，小绳子的拉力与槽码的重力相差增大\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7c51c43e38025d64954f23a71c67c79436b74529c86e2f74d3f45ebfed125a08.png","width":311,"height":237,"width_mm":36.437,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14 题I-图丁\n14-Ⅱ（6分）铂热电阻温度传感器是一种利用铂电阻值随温度变化的特性来测量温度的传感器，其电阻值随温度升高而增大，且具有良好的线性度和稳定性。乙同学选用欧姆表、温度可控的加热装置、电源和导线若干，测出某一小段铂丝在不同温度下的电阻值，并通过作图拟合出电阻值与温度之间的关系。已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0 ^ { \\circ } C"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，阻值 "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { 0 } = 1 0 0 \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 。测量数据记录于下表。\n"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"math","value":"\\quad"},{"type":"text","value":"t /° C"}],[{"type":"text","value":"0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"20"}],[{"type":"text","value":"40"}],[{"type":"text","value":"60"}],[{"type":"text","value":"80"}],[{"type":"text","value":"100"}]],[[{"type":"math","value":"\\quad"},{"type":"text","value":"R/"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"}],[{"type":"text","value":"100.0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"107.6"}],[{"type":"text","value":"115.2"}],[{"type":"text","value":"122.5"}],[{"type":"text","value":"130.4"}],[{"type":"text","value":"138.5"}]]]},{"type":"text","value":"\n（1）选用如图甲所示的多用表，已完成机械调零，应选挡位"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"（选填“×1”“×10”“×100”或“×1k”）然后进行"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"，再进行测量。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3797cecb6ae3c6f5ae0d169e8344a4554407e105671b8632255e7e5d9c1b0799.png","width":514,"height":607,"width_mm":60.36,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14 题II-图甲\n（2）试在下列方格纸中建立标度并作图，求出铂电阻的温度系数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha = \\underline{\\quad} 1 / ^ { \\circ } C"},{"type":"text","value":" (温度系数是指温度每升高 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 ^ { \\circ } C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电阻增加的相对值，即 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha = \\frac { \\Delta R } { R _ { 0 } \\Delta T }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，结果保留3位有效数字)。\nR/"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/834edbae8a17ef9c3aa2042920ca388688245dc602ddc593a42d834ef73f8c32.png","width":786,"height":516,"width_mm":92.38,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）为更精确测量铂电阻随温度动态变化的特性，试提出一种测量新方案，在方框内画出电路图。提供的仪器有电动势和内阻已知的电源、滑动变阻器、多用表（可当电表用）、电压表、开关和导线。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d7880e5f37994d1127092e7322320511436769b62f5f1d12611a8c621912dd67.png","width":1203,"height":359,"width_mm":141.33,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row6"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得到的铂电阻与电池、电流表串联起来（如图乙所示），用这个铂电阻做测温探头，把电流表的电流刻度改为相应的温度刻度，就得到了一个简单的电阻温度计。如果电池的电动势和内阻不变，则温度越高，电流越"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n14-Ⅲ（4分）“用油膜法估测油酸分子的大小”实验\n（1）如图是实验的部分操作步骤，操作步骤合理的顺序是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"（选填图片前的字母）\nA.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/07a9ffc75bcd97e14469de3f93d70f5778976a6128b42179f322ac5176525883.png","width":196,"height":180,"width_mm":23.003,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row7"},{"type":"text","value":"\nB.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1c1b849fc35853164f4ce2ef4888eb60122389015e060bc35d2fbc165bffd577.png","width":188,"height":169,"width_mm":21.899,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row7"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eb1516cfbd687accfb3c1f7b667039075452e18ebdc80ce59267e4d6a903d8f4.png","width":207,"height":192,"width_mm":24.291,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row8"},{"type":"text","value":"\nD.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e17d85aef37240dab84bef93bc34f89f6d186f34ed2a40012546705627ea276f.png","width":217,"height":192,"width_mm":25.395,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row8"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）本实验的理想化假设是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"。（多选）A. 考虑了各油酸分子间的间隙 B. 将油膜看成单分子层油膜 C. 将油酸分子看成球形\n（3）某次实验中将1mL的纯油酸配制成5000mL的油酸酒精溶液，用注射器测得1mL溶液为80滴。如图甲所示，再滴入1滴这样的溶液到准备好的浅盘中。当油酸薄膜的形状稳定后，将玻璃板轻放在浅盘上，如图乙所示，在玻璃板上描出油膜轮廓，每格边长是0.5cm，共144格，根据以上信息，可估算出油酸分子的直径约为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"m（保留2位有效数字）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/578270e8c0c3deb71e412b1d7b809f8b75241504d9cb235871004de4943b1948.png","width":669,"height":258,"width_mm":78.578,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q14-row9"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲（左）、乙（右）\n（4）在实验中，下列操作会导致测得的分子直径偏大的是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"A. 痱子粉撒得太厚B. 计算油膜面积时，将不足半格的方格算一格C. 油酸酒精溶液配制后久置，部分酒精挥发D. 未等油膜形状稳定就开始描绘轮廓\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-I.（1）C　（2）变大　（3）①BC ②C\n"},{"type":"text","value":"14-II.（1）×10　红黑表笔短接调零　（2）温度系数"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha=3.83\\times10^{-3}(1/{}^\\circ\\mathrm C)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ae0c76b5efa5839205cf87373708ad060e5ddf2bdc1c7fb13151aa7023040e6e.png","width":658,"height":480,"width_mm":95},{"type":"text","value":"（3）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/45cca961b6b1269b0727c4e6ac731b7e442113c43fb1530135b4928cc82d3c32.png","width":279,"height":220,"width_mm":60},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a89144b55d46c4ffe74a0e8a9de63103af91b0b27dba88784217f0cf9f21ab9d.png","width":266,"height":281,"width_mm":60},{"type":"text","value":"越小\n"},{"type":"text","value":"14-III.（1）CBDA　（2）BC　（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"6.9\\times10^{-10}"},{"type":"text","value":"（4）A\n"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q15","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"00cd81493568b48823c0cc087dbfd985cc6643104990894d7a4e0c113ffd4104","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. （8分）某同学用空易拉罐和竖直毛细玻璃管自制一个简易气压计，用来检测高度对气压的影响。\n易拉罐容积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"V _ { 0 } = 3 0 0 c m ^ { 3 }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，毛细玻璃管竖直插入罐口并密封，毛细管上端与外界大气相通。管内有一段长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l = 12.5cm"},{"type":"text","value":" 的有色油柱，油柱下方为罐内空气，油柱长度保持不变。毛细管横截面积为"},{"type":"math","value":"S = 0.10cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，油的密度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho = 0.80 \\times 10^{3} kg/m^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。毛细玻璃管上端至密封处距离 30cm，油柱始终在管内。油柱下端到罐口的距离记为x，在一楼、电梯静止、环境温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T _ { 0 } = 3 0 0 K"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，测得 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}=10.0cm"},{"type":"text","value":"。一楼大气压强取 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1.00 \\times 10^{5} P a"},{"type":"text","value":" 。取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。毛细玻璃管足够长且管内气体体积不能忽略。(1）该简易气压计刻度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"（选填“均匀”或“非均匀”）；（2）求在电梯静止在一楼H=0时，罐内的初始气压 "},{"type":"math","value":"P _ { 1 }"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/99b877d4d8b02a481df46326813be6284a0f7de4f6a31ac4a81e2233070bec8f.png","width":588,"height":494,"width_mm":69.009,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图\n（3）该同学把简易气压计带入电梯中做气压检测实验，电梯从一楼开始竖直向上启动（可视为匀加速运动），一小段时间后油柱相对电梯重新稳定。此过程中罐内空气温度仍为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T _ { 0 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 不变，\n高度变化引起的气压变化可忽略。若此时测得 "},{"type":"math","value":"x _ { 1 } = 4 . 0 c m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，请估算电梯向上启动加速度a的大小（结果保留两位有效数字）；\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"（1）非均匀，（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"P_1=1.01\\times10^5\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"a\\approx2.0\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（1）一楼、电梯静止时，油柱上端与外界大气相通，罐内气体压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1=p_0+\\rho gl"},{"type":"text","value":"\n温度不变时，罐内封闭气体满足玻意耳定律"},{"type":"math","value":"p(V_0+Sx)=C"},{"type":"text","value":"\n因此外界大气压强与油柱下端位置"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"的关系为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{\\text{外}}=\\frac{C}{V_0+Sx}-\\rho gl"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可见"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{\\text{外}}"},{"type":"text","value":"与"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"不是线性关系，所以该简易气压计刻度为非均匀。\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）初始时罐内气体压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1=p_0+\\rho gl"},{"type":"text","value":"\n代入数据得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1=1.00\\times10^5+0.80\\times10^3\\times10\\times0.125=1.01\\times10^5\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）初始时罐内空气体积为"},{"type":"math","value":"V_1=V_0+Sx_0=300+0.10\\times10.0=301.0\\mathrm{cm^3}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n电梯向上加速时，在电梯参考系中油柱的等效重力加速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"g'=g+a"},{"type":"text","value":"\n设此时罐内气体压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"p_2=p_0+\\rho(g+a)l"},{"type":"text","value":"\n此时气体体积为"},{"type":"math","value":"V_2=V_0+Sx_1=300+0.10\\times4.0=300.4\\mathrm{cm^3}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由于罐内空气温度不变，根据玻意耳定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1V_1=p_2V_2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即"},{"type":"math","value":"1.01\\times10^5\\times301.0=[1.00\\times10^5+0.80\\times10^3\\times(10+a)\\times0.125]\\times300.4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"a\\approx2.0\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故电梯向上启动加速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"a\\approx2.0\\mathrm{m/s^2}"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608-q16","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--a9-xiezuoti-2608","source_question_id":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"893d46f41e5536c16286ae8563a3f8da498cc500d456d08fa1b09589ecd06ed1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）如图所示，一质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 4.0kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 、长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 2 . 0 m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的均匀长木板放在倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"3 0 ^ { \\circ }"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光滑斜面上，斜面下端内嵌一条倾角相同的足够长的传送带，其与木板间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = { \\frac { \\sqrt { 3 } } { 2 } }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，传送带左侧与光滑斜面平滑连接，初始时传送带静止。长木板右端位于光滑斜面与传送带的临界点，左端系一轻质细线通过光滑定滑轮后连接一质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 1 . 0 k g"},{"type":"text","value":" 的重物。某时刻长木板和重物均由静止释放，已知"},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2694f4650d44b9b7f24bbb04dd55c918a5e91115971b6b30fe5e242300610395.png","width":824,"height":571,"width_mm":96.796,"row_group":"a9-xiezuoti-2608-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16 题图\n（1）求释放瞬间长木板的加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a _ { 0 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 大小；\n（2）求长木板速度最大时长木板的位移 "},{"type":"math","value":"x _ { 0 }"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）若初始时传送带以恒定速率（足够大）逆时针转动，设长木板与传送带接触的长度为x，求长木板和重物的加速度a与x的关系；\n（4）求第（3）小问过程中从开始运动到长木板运动至最低点，传送带对木板施加的摩擦力所做的功:\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关公式或参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"（1）"},{"type":"